summary:
  The sleep timer's end no longer stops a station parked in the sliding buffer.

history:
  The single file's writer ends at its window's cap, so a park left over
  a night stopped recording by itself. The segment writer has no cap: it
  would cut and delete segments until somebody pressed Stop.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                  if (isPlaying() || _casting || _wantsPlaying || (root._tsPaused && timeshift.slide)) stopWithFade();

replace:
                  if (isPlaying() || _casting || _wantsPlaying) stopWithFade();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_sleep_timer_ends_a_park_in_the_sliding_buffer.
  Line-neutral.
